   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Summer 2025 Season Kick‑Off: 4th of July 2025 – Cape Cod Cannabis style in Wellfleet!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Summer’s almost here—and so is the Independence Day weekend you’ve been waiting for! Whether you’re a Cape Cod local or soaking up the salty breeze as a visitor, <a href=\"/directions/\"><b>Cape Cod Cannabis</b> <strong>Recreational Dispensary in South Wellfleet</strong></a> is <a href=\"/menu/\"><em>your go-to cannabis stop</em></a> to gear up for a festive, memorable 4th.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/d9d624e8-4th-of-July-2025-CCC-300x202.png\" alt=\"Summer 2025 Kick-Off: Celebrate 4th of July 2025 with Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"683\" height=\"460\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/4th-of-July-2025-CCC-300x202.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/54df8760-4th-of-July-2025-CCC.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "What’s Happening on Cape Cod for 4th of July 2025?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p><b>Wellfleet Hometown Parade</b></p><p>Classic cars roll down Holbrook Avenue at 9:30 AM sharp—followed by the main parade with floats, and local flair at 10 AM along Main Street.</p></li><li><p><b>Fireworks in the Outer Cape</b></p><p>Catch majestic evening displays in Provincetown Harbor or nearby towns—fireworks abound.</p></li><li><p><b>Baseball Under the Lights</b></p><p>Cap your day with Cape Cod Baseball League games across the region—summer classics with family vibes.</p></li><li><p><b>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary</b></p><p>Open daily for adults 21+ offering the largest selection of quality products at the best prices on Cape Cod.</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Cape Cod Cannabis: Your Holiday Cannabis HQ"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Located in the Route 6 shopping plaza in South Wellfleet, we’re open daily and ready to help you elevate your holiday weekend. From 8 AM to 9 PM (Fri-Sat) and 8 AM to 8 PM on (Sun-Thurs), we’re here early and late to support all your celebration needs. <a href=\"/menu/\">Shop our full menu</a>.</p><p>Stock up on fan-favorite <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">refreshing edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vaporizers</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\">accessories</a>, and our <a href=\"/categories/merch/\">exclusive summer merch</a>. Plus, <a href=\"/loyalty-sign-up/\">join our Loyalty VIP Program</a> and <a href=\"/specials/\">Blazing Bargains &amp; Bundles</a> you won’t want to miss.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Plan Your Day Cape Cod Style"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ol start=\"1\"><li><p><b>Morning</b> – Parade, family fun, and maybe a scenic bike ride along the Cape Cod Rail Trail.</p></li><li><p><b>Afternoon</b> – Chill at Marconi Beach with seal sightings and salty air —or catch a baseball game.</p></li><li><p><b>Any time of the day</b> – Easy stop at Cape Cod Cannabis for extras like <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a>, or <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\">cool accessories.</a> Check out our <a href=\"/specials/\"><strong>Bundles &amp; Blazing Bargains</strong></a> too!</p></li><li><p><b>Night</b> – Head out to enjoy fireworks reflecting over the harbor—pure Independence Day magic.</p></li><li><strong>Have fun, be safe</strong> – And, as always, celebrate responsibly.</li></ol>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/specials/\"><img src=\"assets/source/b4fd39f5-Bundles-Blazing-Bargains-1176x500-1-1024x435.png\" alt=\"Shop our Bundles and Blazing Bargains and SAVE at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MAShop our Bundles and Blazing Bargains and SAVE at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MAShop our Bundles and Blazing Bargains and SAVE at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MAShop our Bundles and Blazing Bargains and SAVE at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MAShop our Bundles and Blazing Bargains and SAVE at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"789\" height=\"335\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bundles-Blazing-Bargains-1176x500-1-1024x435.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/ec83c8d2-Bundles-Blazing-Bargains-1176x500-1.png\"></a></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Why Cape Cod Cannabis is The Best Recreational Dispensary on Cape Cod…"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p><b>Local and Visitor Friendly with Cool Vibes </b>– Welcoming and knowledgable staff serving Cape Cod and tourists alike.</p></li><li><p><b>The Largest Selection of Quality Products at the Best Prices on Cape Cod</b> – <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">Flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/strains/high-cbd/\">CBD</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>—you name it.</p></li><li><p><b>Convenience</b> – <a href=\"/menu/\">Online ordering</a>, easy parking, Route 6 access—no stress, just chill. <strong><em>It’s worth the trip!</em></strong></p></li><li><p><b>Summer Deals &amp; Blazing Bargains</b> – <a href=\"/specials/\">Bundles &amp; Blazing Bargains</a>, and <a href=\"/shop-your-loyalty-points/\">VIP perks</a>—stay tuned via our Loyalty VIP program!</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Your 4th‑of‑July Cannabis Checklist:"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p>Pay us a <a href=\"/directions/\">visit</a> before you hit the beach or parade.</p></li><li><p>Dive into our summer <a href=\"/specials/\">bundles</a> &amp; <a href=\"/shop-your-loyalty-points/\">VIP rewards</a>.</p></li><li><p>Take home your holiday essentials—<a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vaporizers</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/strains/high-cbd/\">CBD</a>, <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\">accessories</a>, and more.</p></li><li><p><em><strong>Enjoy a safe, happy, and elevated Independence Day—Cape Cod Cannabis style and celebrate responsibly!</strong></em></p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/bcf39e26-CCC_Logo_650px-300x254.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"300\" height=\"254\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/CCC_Logo_650px-300x254.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/95c5c457-CCC_Logo_650px.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Let Freedom—and Good Times—Blaze!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>This 4th of July, set yourself up for a perfect Cape Cod celebration—with parades, beaches, baseball and fireworks—and stop by <b>Cape Cod Cannabis</b> <strong>Recreational Dispensary</strong> to complete the experience. From sunrise strolls to star-lit displays, we’ve got the <a href=\"/menu/\">holiday cannabis essentials</a> to make your weekend unforgettable.</p><p><b>See you in Wellfleet—Happy Independence Day! Celebrate responsibly.</b></p>"
    }
   ]
  },
